{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 35,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Healing on the Sabbath"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He entered the synagogue again, and a man was there who had a withered hand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they watched Him closely, whether He would heal him on the Sabbath, so that they might "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "bring charges against"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "accuse Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to the man who had the withered hand, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Arise into the midst"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Step forward.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Is it lawful on the Sabbath to do good or to do evil, to save life or to kill?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " But they kept silent. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when He had looked around at them with anger, being grieved by the hardness of their hearts, He said to the man, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Stretch out your hand.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And he stretched "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " out, and his hand was restored "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits as whole as the other"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as whole as the other. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Pharisees went out and immediately plotted with the Herodians against Him, how they might destroy Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Great Multitude Follows Jesus"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jesus withdrew with His disciples to the sea. And a great multitude from Galilee followed Him, and from Judea "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and Jerusalem and Idumea and beyond the Jordan; and those from Tyre and Sidon, a great multitude, when they heard how many things He was doing, came to Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So He told His disciples that a small boat should be kept ready for Him because of the multitude, lest they should crush Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For He healed many, so that as many as had afflictions pressed about Him to touch Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the unclean spirits, whenever they saw Him, fell down before Him and cried out, saying, “You are the Son of God.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But He sternly warned them that they should not make Him known."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Twelve Apostles"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He went up on the mountain and called to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " those He Himself wanted. And they came to Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He appointed twelve, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU adds whom He also named apostles"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that they might be with Him and that He might send them out to preach, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and to have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "authority"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "power "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits to heal sicknesses and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to heal sicknesses and to cast out demons: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU and He appointed the twelve: Simon . . ."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Simon, to whom He gave the name Peter; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "James the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "son"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Zebedee and John the brother of James, to whom He gave the name Boanerges, that is, “Sons of Thunder”; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, James the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "son"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Alphaeus, Thaddaeus, Simon the Cananite; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and Judas Iscariot, who also betrayed Him. And they went into a house."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A House Divided Cannot Stand"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the multitude came together again, so that they could not so much as eat bread. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when His own people heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "about this,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they went out to lay hold of Him, for they said, “He is out of His mind.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the scribes who came down from Jerusalem said, “He has Beelzebub,” and, “By the ruler of the demons He casts out demons.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So He called them to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Himself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and said to them in parables: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“How can Satan cast out Satan?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "If a kingdom is divided against itself, that kingdom cannot stand."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And if a house is divided against itself, that house cannot stand."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And if Satan has risen up against himself, and is divided, he cannot stand, but has an end."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "No one can enter a strong man’s house and plunder his goods, unless he first binds the strong man. And then he will plunder his house."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Unpardonable Sin"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Assuredly, I say to you, all sins will be forgiven the sons of men, and whatever blasphemies they may utter;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "but he who blasphemes against the Holy Spirit never has forgiveness, but is subject to eternal condemnation”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "because they said, “He has an unclean spirit.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus’ Mother and Brothers Send for Him"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then His brothers and His mother came, and standing outside they sent to Him, calling Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And a multitude was sitting around Him; and they said to Him, “Look, Your mother and Your brothers "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M add and Your sisters"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "are outside seeking You.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But He answered them, saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Who is My mother, or My brothers?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He looked around in a circle at those who sat about Him, and said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Here are My mother and My brothers!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For whoever does the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "will of God is My brother and My sister and mother.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}